  m_Text: "To add event URL links, scroll down to the LINKS section of the achievement
    personalization screen. Add a Title for your chosen link (e.g. Proof of Time
    or Event Blog). Then, find the referenced web page in your web browser and copy
    the URL link. Back in the app, tap \u201CURL\u201D and paste in the available
    text field. Tap the Save icon.\r"
