  m_Text: "To bring an achievement to life, \x03you must have a strong internet connection.
    First, tap the Saved icon in the bottom menu bar. \x03Select your event. Then,
    tap the yellow Blingar icon to activate your camera. Point your camera at your
    medal (or other solid surface) and hold it steady. Your augmented reality experience
    should begin within a few seconds. Any delay will be due to your internet signal
    strength.\r\n"
